  "2026-09-18T09:53:06.156Z","harness:codex","Delivery evidence: implemented under the claimed uniform-output parent and isolated this completed GH-1271 child for accurate package-generated release notes. Shared SDK validation and renderer resolution accept canonical JSON/TOON on mutations; read-only controls still refuse before writes. Linked sandboxed integration run passed both real CLI/SDK lifecycle tests. Final repository coverage passed 8997 tests in 705 files with 64806/64806 statements, 49453/49453 branches, 13451/13451 functions and 62027/62027 lines. Typecheck, strict docstring coverage, targeted ESLint, duplication, contract snapshots, secret/dependency scans and packed npm/npx/Bun/bunx consumers passed. Manual Node/Bun temporary-workspace acceptance exercised mutations and reads. Hosted PR checks and review are the remaining delivery gates; these results do not claim a published release."
