body: "GitHub report: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1271\n\nThis focused delivery implements the mutation-encoding portion of the broader uniform-output contract. Canonical outputFormat/output_format selects JSON or TOON before read-surface resolution, while validation continues to reject read-only shaping controls on writes and hybrid mutation modes before execution. Existing --json compatibility remains intact.\n\nThe shared SDK owns validation and renderer resolution; the CLI help describes encoding as available for reads and mutations. Regression coverage exercises create, update, comments and close through the real CLI, runAction create through the SDK, TOON output, invalid encodings and pre-mutation refusal of output limits. Temporary-workspace acceptance also exercises Node and Bun; the full repository suite passes at exact 100/100/100/100 coverage.\n\nThe parent remains open for remaining command classification and universal envelope specification work. This child records the independently delivered defect fix so the package-owned changelog includes it."
